{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49114","headline":"一斛珠 · 後主煜","name":"一斛珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚妆初过，沈檀轻注些儿个，向人微露丁香颗。\n一曲清歌，暂引樱桃破。\n罗袖裛残殷色可，杯深旋被香醪涴，绣牀斜凭娇无那。\n烂嚼红茸，笑向檀郎唾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}